' Entry point for the Rooibos device/simulator test build (bsconfig.test.json).
' Kept separate from the channel entry point (source/main.bs) so the two never
' collide: the test build excludes the channel main and ships only this one,
' whose sole job is to hand control to the Rooibos runner. Rooibos then loads
' the auto-generated RooibosScene, runs every @suite and reports results.
sub main()
    rooibos_init("RooibosScene")
end sub
